{"ID":"20240206105201-d8w9if2","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240206105201-d8w9if2","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105201-d8w9if2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105210-n6m0y6t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607132022-x6oteol\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1700,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620111652-f1l1ucc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"083薇衔（鹿衔草、鹿蹄草）","type":"doc","updated":"20240808091828"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206105210-n6m0y6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105210-n6m0y6t","updated":"20240206105214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于甘肃、陕西、河南、安徽等地。\n【性状】\t干燥全草，茎紫褐色，稍具棱，并有皱纹，无毛，微有光泽。叶柄长，扁平而中央凹下，两边呈膜质状，常弯曲，无毛。叶片皱缩，稍破碎，上面紫红色，少有呈棕绿色者，光滑，下面紫红色，无毛，叶脉微突；纸质，易碎。有时可见花茎，上有数朵小花或扁球形棕色蒴果。气无，味微苦。\n【性味】\t甘、苦，温。\n【功效】\t补虚、益肾、祛风除湿、活血调经、补肾强骨、祛风除湿、止咳、止血。主肾虚腰痛、风湿痹痛、筋骨痿软、新久咳嗽、吐血、衄血、崩漏、外伤出血。"}]},{"ID":"20240206105205-wdsantq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105205-wdsantq","updated":"20240206105205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206105205-bm5m89z.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240808084439-u7nmrs8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240808084439-u7nmrs8","updated":"20240808084440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鹿衔草"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鹿衔草-20240808084440-ve7iatq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 309px;","style":"width: 299px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鹿衔草6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鹿衔草6-20240620111405-kgktyd6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 299px;\" parent-style=\"width: 309px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240808084451-ebc0wn7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240808084451-ebc0wn7","updated":"20240808085953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鹿衔草 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鹿衔草 1-20240808084633-rnommpv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 899px;","style":"width: 889px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鹿衔草7"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鹿衔草7-20240620111650-g48x6jr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 889px;\" parent-style=\"width: 899px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240808085839-rj0h3tl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240808085839-rj0h3tl","updated":"20240808091828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 390px;","style":"width: 380px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240620111225-ncgrotj.png"},{"Type